u_{1}\\), \\(
u_{2}\\)) and the third axis shows a correlation function of the spectral intensities observed at \\(
u_{1}\\) and \\(
u_{2}\\).""")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym goldbook:08296 "2-D correlation spectrum")
