Declaration(Class(goldbook:10547))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:10547 "combined repeated dose toxicity study")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:10547 "Procedure to evaluate both general systemic toxicity, with an emphasis on neurological endpoints, and notably reproductive effects and developmental progression in rodents. Groups of males and females are administered a test substance in graded doses prior to mating, during the mating period, and subsequently (up to two weeks post-mating in males and four days post-delivery in females).")
Declaration(Class(goldbook:10548))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:10548 "compaction")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:10548 """Complication of labor in twin births in which there is attempted simultaneous expulsion of both twins, so that the lower part of the mother’s pelvis is filled and further descent through the birth canal is prevented.
In embryology, process during which blastomeres change their shape and align themselves tightly against each other to form the compact morula.""")
Declaration(Class(goldbook:10549))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:10549 "conal growth hypothesis")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:10549 "Hypothesis that explains transposition of the great arteries of the heart by failure of the aortopulmonary septum to follow a spiral course during partitioning of the bulbus cordis and truncus arteriosus in the process of forming the aorta and pulmonary trunk.")
Declaration(Class(goldbook:10550))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:10550 "conception")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:10550 "Formation of a viable zygote by the union of a spermatozoon and an ovum.")
Declaration(Class(goldbook:10551))
