AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:10598 "Procedure in which female rodents are exposed to a test substance from the time of implantation through all of lactation; offspring may be exposed during the preweaning period, either directly or through milk, and are studied with regard to neurologic and behavioral abnormalities during postnatal development and until adulthood.")
Declaration(Class(goldbook:10599))
