(n) Fertilized eggs of mature adult fish, etc.""")
Declaration(Class(goldbook:11234))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:11234 "spawning")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11234 """(n) Release of gametes (eggs or sperm) from mature adult fish, frogs, molluscs, crustacea, etc.
(adj) Describing behavior related to the readiness of mature adult fish, etc. to release gametes.""")
Declaration(Class(goldbook:11235))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:11235 "Spemann organizer")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11235 "Group of cells in the amphibian embryo that is important in orientation of surrounding cells and facilitates development of the central nervous system.")
Declaration(Class(goldbook:11236))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:11236 "sperm banking")
